      "policy_quote": "Prescriptions with `schedule` equal to `C-II` (controlled substances) can never be refilled through this channel. For such prescriptions you must transfer the patient to a pharmacist with `transfer_to_pharmacist` and must not call `request_refill`.",
      "requirement": "The transfer to a pharmacist must occur for any request involving a prescription with a `schedule` of `C-II` (e.g., oxycodone)."
