      "policy_quote": "Before any action that changes data (`request_refill`, `update_address`, `cancel_order`), list the action details and obtain explicit user confirmation (\"yes\"/\"да\") for those exact details.",
      "requirement": "Explicit user confirmation must be obtained before transferring the patient to a pharmacist, if the policy requires confirmation for actions involving sensitive or critical changes (e.g., controlled substances)."
    },
